# stele — copy to .env.local (Vite auto-loads it) and fill in.
#
# STELE ships as a single offline HTML file by design ("Getting Started" in
# README.md) — nothing here is required. Leaving this unset (the default) is
# a fully supported, fully offline build; only set it if you want THIS build
# to durably mirror its audit trail to a deployed stele-core instance.
#
# Baked into the bundle at `vite build` time (see vite.config.ts's
# __STELE_VERSION__ define for the same mechanism) — not runtime-configurable
# per copy of the built HTML file. See stele-core/README.md "Deploy" for how
# to actually stand one up.
VITE_STELE_CORE_URL=""
